&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 11.33px"&gt;
&lt;td colspan="5" style="vertical-align: top; width: 529.2px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;３．事業戦略を牽引する先鋭人材の確保&lt;/span&gt;
